        "original_id": "b827bc06-408e-558e-8e56-f624ad222c51",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Diego Félix of Austria, Philip II of Spain, Anna of Austria\n- Roles: Prince of Asturias and Portugal, lord of the Seventeen Provinces of the Netherlands\n- Places: Spain, Portugal, the Netherlands\n\nFacts:\n- From 1555, Philip II of Spain was lord of the Seventeen Provinces of the Netherlands.\n- Diego Félix of Austria was born on August 15, 1575, and died on November 21, 1582.\n- Diego Félix of Austria was Prince of Asturias and Portugal.\n- Diego Félix of Austria was the fourth son of Philip II of Spain.\n- Diego Félix of Austria was the third son of Philip II of Spain and Anna of Austria.",
